Figure mesh (app/src/main/resources/dev/gzclp/tracker/form/body.bin)

  Made by tools/body-mesh.py from three MakeHuman assets: the hm08 base mesh
  (makehuman/data/3dobjs/base.obj), the default skeleton
  (makehuman/data/rigs/default.mhskel) and its skin weights
  (makehuman/data/rigs/default_weights.mhw), at commit
  a8bc2d54ff0ac92e78ff71431b1023eda42bf482 of
  https://github.com/makehumancommunity/makehuman

  Copyright (C) 2020-2021 Data Collection AB, Joel Palmius, Jonas Hauquier.
  Released under CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication):
  https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

  The mesh is decimated, posed and refitted to the app's skeleton. MakeHuman's
  source code (AGPL) is not used or included.

